{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1548092-discord-living-world-20th-anniversary-world-of-darkness-detroit","id":1548092,"title":"[Discord][Living World][20th Anniversary] World of Darkness: Detroit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-01-31T08:38:49-08:00","id":1548092,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon6.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> [Discord][Living World][20th Anniversary] World of Darkness: Detroit","content":"Want to play in a game on a collision course with the End Times? Come play with us!<br /> <br /> <b>Name:</b> Detroit: A City On Fire (DCoF)<br /> <b>System:</b> 20th Anniversary<br /> <b>Play Style:</b> Play by Post | Chat Style<br /> <b>Language:</b> English<br /> <b>Setting: </b>Detroit, MI, USA<br /> <b>Time:</b> Current (2024/2025)<br /> <b>Requirements (age restrictions etc.):</b> 18+, Active Players<br /> <b>Number of Players:</b> Many.<br /> <b>How to get in:</b> Follow the Discord Invite Link (Below)<br /> <b>Further Info: </b>This game is based in modern times (2024) in Detroit, Michigan. I am currently accepting Vampires and Werewolves with starting sheets only. This game has a finite lifespan - as this is an End Times game. Eventually, this game and its setting will come to an end. finite lifespan. I am using 20th anniversary rules with a small amount of lore updates from 5th edition mixed into the revised/20th lore. No lurkers, please.<br /> <br /> While this game does accept multiple splats, it is not a &quot;forced crossover&quot; game. You can play through the entire game without ever encountering someone in another splat if you choose. You also have the choice to cross over in specific channels.<br /> <br /> <b>Discord Link:</b> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JBGS8bBMDc\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/JBGS8bBMDc</a><br /> <br /> Please note, we have a 30 day inactivity rule so you will be expected to make and finish a sheet within 30 days of joining.<br /> <br /> The game is currently accepting Vampires and Werewolves only. No ghouls, kinfolk, fera, etc. Camarilla, Anarch and Indie vampires only.<br /> <br /> Hope to see you there!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28648-thatskarma4u","name":"ThatsKarma4U","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28648_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-14T00:03:14-07:00","id":1549287,"title":"","content":"# Detroit: City on Fire<br /> ## A World of Darkness Play-by-Post RPG<br /> **System:** V20 (with select V5 lore elements)<br /> **Playable Characters:** Camarilla, Werewolves, Wraiths<br /> **Homebrew:** Custom lore adaptations, unique clan structures, and an evolving city-based metaplot<br /> **Style:** Play-by-Post<br /> **Language:** English<br /> <br /> # The Story So Far\u2026<br /> <br /> ## Kindred of Detroit<br /> The city fell to the Sabbat in 1967, its streets slick with blood as the Sword of Caine claimed their prize. For decades, Detroit became a hunting ground, where monsters ruled and Devil\u2019s Night turned into an annual festival of fire and carnage.<br /> <br /> Then came 2020. Under the cover of pandemic lockdowns, Prince Esme del Castillo led a brutal and silent coup, erasing the Sabbat in one of the deadliest Camarilla operations in history. Detroit is Camarilla now. But old wounds fester, and the city is far from stable.<br /> <br /> The Kindred fight to control what\u2019s left. Anarchs struggle for their crumbling domains. The Tremere fracture into warring chantries. The Nosferatu whisper of something ancient stirring beneath the city\u2014something that should have stayed buried. And in the shadows, the Sabbat are not gone. They are waiting. Watching. Bleeding the city dry.<br /> <br /> ## The Werewolves of Detroit<br /> The Garou are dying. The Battle of Zug Island in the 1990s was meant to break the Wyrm\u2019s stranglehold on Detroit, but instead, it shattered the werewolves. Entire Septs were lost, Caerns went silent, and something awakened beneath the river - something so vile, so unnatural, it has begun to erase memory itself. The werewolves keep fighting, but the truth is worse than they dare admit: they are losing.<br /> <br /> ## The Wraiths of Detroit<br /> The Wraiths of Detroit are trapped. The Sixth Great Maelstrom shattered the Underworld, leaving Detroit\u2019s ghosts stranded in a Necropolis cut off from the afterlife. No Ferrymen. No Hierarchy. No escape. The dead are vanishing. Some whisper of a force devouring souls. Others have turned on each other, feeding on memory itself to survive. Whatever is causing it? It\u2019s still hungry.<br /> <br /> # Who Will You Be?<br /> The shadows of Detroit are teeming with predators, warriors, and ghosts of the past. Whether you fight for power, survival, or something deeper, the city is a battlefield\u2014and the war has only begun.<br /> <br /> * **Kindred** \u2013 The Camarilla tightens its hold, the Anarchs fight for survival, and Sabbat remnants scheme in the darkness. Will you uphold the Masquerade, or tear it all down?<br /> * **Garou** \u2013 The werewolves of Detroit are fractured, desperate, and dying. Some still fight the Wyrm, others have turned to darker methods, and a few ask the unthinkable\u2014has Gaia already lost?<br /> * **Wraiths** \u2013 Detroit\u2019s ghosts never rest. Bound by chains of unfinished business, will you defy Oblivion, or embrace the darkness below?<br /> <br /> **Detroit is burning once again.**<br /> **The only question is: where do you stand?**<br /> <br /> ## The City is on Fire. Join Us In The Flames.<br /> <br /> Do you have the ambition to rise, the strength to survive, or the ruthlessness to take what\u2019s yours?<br /> <br /> ## The City is on Fire. Join Us In The Flames. Detroit awaits.<br /> <br /> Join Our Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/knUkCF9q\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/knUkCF9q</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28648-thatskarma4u","name":"ThatsKarma4U","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28648_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}